---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="The Dream Eater’s Bargain | Patrick O’Dell">
  <section class="book-page">
    <div class="container">

      <img class="cover" src="/the-dream-eaters-bargain-cover.jpg" alt="Dream Eater’s Bargain cover" />

      <h1>The Dream Eater’s Bargain</h1>
      <p class="series">The Godfire Series</p>

      <p class="blurb">
        Elias Fetch’s power is fading when Somnus, the ruler of the Dream Realm, offers him a bargain: hunt down escaped Dream Lords before they consume both worlds.
      </p>

      <p class="blurb">
        The deeper he goes, the more the Dream Realm begins to reflect something personal, and dangerous.
      </p>

      <p class="blurb">
        By the end of the hunt, Elias realizes the real threat was never what he was chasing.
      </p>

      <div class="actions">
        <a href="#" class="btn">Preorder (Coming Soon)</a>
        <a href="/books" class="btn secondary">Back to Books</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
.book-page { padding: 80px 20px; }
.container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
.cover { width: 260px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.series { opacity: 0.6; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-size: 0.8rem; }
.blurb { text-align: left; margin: 16px auto; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 650px; opacity: 0.85; }
.actions { margin-top: 30px; display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; }
.btn { padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid black; text-decoration: none; color: black; }
.secondary { opacity: 0.6; }
</style>
